    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422120/extras/29644f7e85a7bdb759b77877888916e5.poster.avif?t=1755097896\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422120/extras/29644f7e85a7bdb759b77877888916e5.webm?t=1755097896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422120/extras/29644f7e85a7bdb759b77877888916e5.mp4?t=1755097896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422120/extras/d3d7050a08b1ff3cf28b899e9a472e07.avif?t=1755097896\" width=600 height=100 /></span>Guy is planning a meeting with his girlfriend to use their shared photos to prank board visitors with provocative posts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They are both hikikomori who enjoy hanging out together, but circumstances prevent them from living together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Having been traumatized by their past, they must go through a difficult journey of adapting to a new, still unfamiliar life.\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422120/extras/e5642f1000aacb4b3286406c36b306f1.avif?t=1755097896\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br>I don\u2019t know their names. In general, I don\u2019t know that much... But I\u2019ll try to tell you something!<strong><i> </i></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422120/extras/074cd07bad61a8716ad3e5d5e0c954ae.poster.avif?t=1755097896\" width=800 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422120/extras/074cd07bad61a8716ad3e5d5e0c954ae.webm?t=1755097896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422120/extras/074cd07bad61a8716ad3e5d5e0c954ae.mp4?t=1755097896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Girl. A little (or maybe a lot???) crazy, energetic, and bright personality. She stutters when embarrassed, loves to tease, provoke, or say something silly... just to let her emotions out! She has a complicated relationship with her parents, she\u2019s an introvert... And sometimes she experiences panic attacks (don\u2019t tell her I told you that)!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422120/extras/1888fddb44d843291c4b982b0630f22e.poster.avif?t=1755097896\" width=800 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422120/extras/1888fddb44d843291c4b982b0630f22e.webm?t=1755097896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422120/extras/1888fddb44d843291c4b982b0630f22e.mp4?t=1755097896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong><i> </i></strong><br> Guy. A calm, sometimes a bit slow... but very attentive and caring young man (not the tidiest one, I must say!). He is shorter than her, but that doesn\u2019t bother them at all. He tends to be overprotective of the girl but tries to overcome it. He always wears long-sleeved clothes... I can\u2019t say what happened to his parents. However, he is feeling much better now, really!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422120/extras/6db68c6efed87f9cc147cc4dfce05207.poster.avif?t=1755097896\" width=800 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422120/extras/6db68c6efed87f9cc147cc4dfce05207.webm?t=1755097896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422120/extras/6db68c6efed87f9cc147cc4dfce05207.mp4?t=1755097896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>The queen, Miss Galaxy, the ruler of the world! Or just Tonya. A big Flemish Giant rabbit. She currently lives at the guy\u2019s house, though she used to live on his parents\u2019 farm. She loves to chew on clothes and zoom around at night (well, she is a nocturnal animal). Despite her size, she\u2019s the girl\u2019s favorite stress reliever.<i><strong></strong></i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422120/extras/7948f520e8c00f450197342f883a1896.avif?t=1755097896\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, our menu is an old-school CRT monitor with exhaust pipes! (don\u2019t ask...)<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422120/extras/d45de4b890f5f59889513ba47607f984.poster.avif?t=1755097896\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422120/extras/d45de4b890f5f59889513ba47607f984.webm?t=1755097896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422120/extras/d45de4b890f5f59889513ba47607f984.mp4?t=1755097896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>And our textbox is a multimedia device! Inside, you\u2019ll find everything you need\u2014video settings, audio settings, and much more. The technology may be old, but it still works!<strong><i> </i></strong><br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422120/extras/7e72eb201ddb3c6d639033cbe36ee9be.poster.avif?t=1755097896\" width=600 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422120/extras/7e72eb201ddb3c6d639033cbe36ee9be.webm?t=1755097896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422120/extras/7e72eb201ddb3c6d639033cbe36ee9be.mp4?t=1755097896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The girl loves to draw, and you will need to create a drawing for the guy, made by her hand! I hope you manage to make something at least a little better than mine...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422120/extras/ae4f1c3713bf243316ffc1dc72b450b6.poster.avif?t=1755097896\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422120/extras/ae4f1c3713bf243316ffc1dc72b450b6.webm?t=1755097896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422120/extras/ae4f1c3713bf243316ffc1dc72b450b6.mp4?t=1755097896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>We tried to add as many animations, camera work, and directing techniques as possible to make the visuals more dynamic and alive! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422120/extras/7391cea6ea0b5b23c5fdae46340c0c9c.poster.avif?t=1755097896\" width=800 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422120/extras/7391cea6ea0b5b23c5fdae46340c0c9c.webm?t=1755097896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422120/extras/7391cea6ea0b5b23c5fdae46340c0c9c.mp4?t=1755097896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong><i> </i></strong><br> This is a deeply personal story filled with psychological depth, drama, love, and so much more\u2014things that cannot be expressed in words but can only be felt through reading. And I really hope that everyone who reads it will understand what I mean ^^. Enjoy! <br> <br> </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422120/extras/29644f7e85a7bdb759b77877888916e5.poster.avif?t=1755097896\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422120/extras/29644f7e85a7bdb759b77877888916e5.webm?t=1755097896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422120/extras/29644f7e85a7bdb759b77877888916e5.mp4?t=1755097896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422120/extras/d3d7050a08b1ff3cf28b899e9a472e07.avif?t=1755097896\" width=600 height=100 /></span>Guy is planning a meeting with his girlfriend to use their shared photos to prank board visitors with provocative posts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They are both hikikomori who enjoy hanging out together, but circumstances prevent them from living together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Having been traumatized by their past, they must go through a difficult journey of adapting to a new, still unfamiliar life.\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422120/extras/e5642f1000aacb4b3286406c36b306f1.avif?t=1755097896\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br>I don\u2019t know their names. In general, I don\u2019t know that much... But I\u2019ll try to tell you something!<strong><i> </i></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422120/extras/074cd07bad61a8716ad3e5d5e0c954ae.poster.avif?t=1755097896\" width=800 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.co