800 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422120/extras/6db68c6efed87f9cc147cc4dfce05207.webm?t=1755097896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422120/extras/6db68c6efed87f9cc147cc4dfce05207.mp4?t=1755097896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>The queen, Miss Galaxy, the ruler of the world! Or just Tonya. A big Flemish Giant rabbit. She currently lives at the guy\u2019s house, though she used to live on his parents\u2019 farm. She loves to chew on clothes and zoom around at night (well, she is a nocturnal animal). Despite her size, she\u2019s the girl\u2019s favorite stress reliever.<i><strong></strong></i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422120/extras/7948f520e8c00f450197342f883a1896.avif?t=1755097896\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, our menu is an old-school CRT monitor with exhaust pipes! (don\u2019t ask...)<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422120/extras/d45de4b890f5f59889513ba47607f984.poster.avif?t=1755097896\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422120/extras/d45de4b890f5f59889513ba47607f984.webm?t=1755097896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422120/extras/d45de4b890f5f59889513ba47607f984.mp4?t=1755097896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>And our textbox is a multimedia device! Inside, you\u2019ll find everything you need\u2014video settings, audio settings, and much more. The technology may be old, but it still works!<strong><i> </i></strong><br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422120/extras/7e72eb201ddb3c6d639033cbe36ee9be.poster.avif?t=1755097896\" width=600 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422120/extras/7e72eb201ddb3c6d639033cbe36ee9be.webm?t=1755097896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422120/extras/7e72eb201ddb3c6d639033cbe36ee9be.mp4?t=1755097896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The girl loves to draw, and you will need to create a drawing for the guy, made by her hand! I hope you manage to make something at least a little better than mine...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422120/extras/ae4f1c3713bf243316ffc1dc72b450b6.poster.avif?t=1755097896\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422120/extras/ae4f1c3713bf243316ffc1dc72b450b6.webm?t=1755097896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422120/extras/ae4f1c3713bf243316ffc1dc72b450b6.mp4?t=1755097896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>We tried to add as many animations, camera work, and directing techniques as possible to make the visuals more dynamic and alive! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422120/extras/7391cea6ea0b5b23c5fdae46340c0c9c.poster.avif?t=1755097896\" width=800 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422120/extras/7391cea6ea0b5b23c5fdae46340c0c9c.webm?t=1755097896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422120/extras/7391cea6ea0b5b23c5fdae46340c0c9c.mp4?t=1755097896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong><i> </i></strong><br> This is a deeply personal story filled with psychological depth, drama, love, and so much more\u2014things that cannot be expressed in words but can only be felt through reading. And I really hope that everyone who reads it will understand what I mean ^^. Enjoy! <br> <br> </p>",
